Subject: [PATCH 358/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0357: ignore
 events from a discarded recognizer, restart on a new recognizer, report a
 failed start once, and keep the watchdog off a permission prompt

A discarded recognizer is detached and its events ignored, so a stale end or error cannot cancel the next start's watchdog. restart() and the watchdog build a fresh SpeechRecognition so start() runs inside the tap on WebKit. A failed start reports false once per take. The watchdog waits 8 s on the first take, 4 s after, and not while the mic permission is not granted. The tap to start the mic shows only on the browser path and never withdraws a server start. The level meter's reacquire count resets after 30 s live and a failed reacquire retries once.

Signed-off-by: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
